{"sourceUrl":"https://ic.zju.edu.cn/2026/0807/c54013a3193921/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:13.018907+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://ic.zju.edu.cn/2026/0807/c54013a3193921/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span>浙江大学集成电路学院竭诚欢迎全国高校<strong><span>（含本校）</span></strong>优秀本科毕业生推荐免试来我院攻读研究生。</span></p><p><span>学校推荐免试系统将于<span>8</span>月<span>10</span>日</span><span>开放，集成电路学院申请截止时间为</span><strong><span>9</span><span>月</span></strong><strong><span>10</span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span></span></strong><span>。请有意申请我院推荐免试研究生的同学务必于系统开放后，</span><strong><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>10</span><span><span>日</span></span></strong><span>前通过系统进行报名，并按研究所进行报名。</span><span>具体方法及要求详见研究生院网站：<a href=\"http://www.grs.zju.edu.cn/yjszs/2026/0805/c28479a3193539/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"浙江大学关于2027年接收外校推荐免试研究生工作安排的通知\"><span>http://www.grs.zju.edu.cn/yjszs/2026/0805/c28479a3193539/page.htm</span></a></span></p><p><span><span><span>欢迎</span><strong><span>本校</span></strong><span>及</span><strong><span>外校</span></strong><span>同学通过本系统报名。</span></span></span></p><p><span>报名系统</span><span>材料提交：</span><span>请按以下顺序将材料扫描整理成一个PDF文件并上传到报名系统（大小不要超过10M），无需邮寄纸质材料。材料主要包括：</span></p><p><span>1.有效身份证（正反面）扫描件；</span></p><p><span>2.本科成绩单（须加盖学校教务处或院系公章）；</span></p><p><span>3.本科前三年（或前5学期）专业总评成绩排名证明，须加盖学校教务处或院系公章；</span></p><p><span>4.外语水平证明；</span></p><p><span>5.已发表论文、获奖证书等其他材料；</span></p><p><span>6.</span><strong><span>申请直接攻博的考生</span></strong><span>还须提供两名集成电路专业领域内</span><strong><span>副教授及以上职称</span></strong><span>专家（或相当专业职称的专家）的书面推荐意见（模板见附件）。</span></p><p><span><span>导师信息及对应的招生方向详见附件表格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系人：周老师、赵老师     电话</span><span>：<span>0571-82359117、</span></span></span><span>0571-82990603</span></p><p><span>邮箱：<span>feiyangzhou@zju.edu.cn、</span></span><span><a href=\"mailto:zhaofurong@zju.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>zhaofurong@zju.edu.cn</span></a><br/><span>   </span><span>未尽事宜详见：</span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/J2_z9kN7Q-ech0PBRwNvIw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/J2_z9kN7Q-ech0PBRwNvIw</span></a></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ic.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://ic.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/94/36/18623b8c48d0bdd01227a3f508de/8c838cee-92e5-4742-ba6d-0c2b029f5cf1.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>专家推荐信（直博生复试时提交）.docx</span></a></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ic.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_xls.gif\"/><a href=\"https://ic.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/94/36/18623b8c48d0bdd01227a3f508de/5256eec4-e113-4530-8bc4-1d7613a3c797.xlsx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>集成电路学院导师信息20260807.xlsx</span></a></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p>浙江大学集成电路学院<br/></p><p><span>2026</span>年<span>8</span>月<span>7</span>日</p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"2b63a8167f0c987fef50e30417f168cefebb88a8a0b6023c93077a9509f147e7","textLength":688,"sourceSha256":"b2ff465f0a24c025e4a63ea0ae62a5f318ff8cc7d1e82f6fb13a32f122c3daae","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-4a4a4f95640b64d31273","title":"2026年浙江大学集成电路学院关于接收2027级推荐免试研究生工作安排的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:13.018907+00:00"}
